{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06445","headline":"奉送漪叔游颍川兼谒淮阳太守 · 李颀","name":"奉送漪叔游颍川兼谒淮阳太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢吏今何适，辞家方独行。\n嵩阳入归梦，颍水半前程。\n闻道淮阳守，东南卧理清。\n郡斋观政日，人马望乡情。\n叠岭雪初霁，寒砧霜後鸣。\n临川嗟拜手，寂寞事躬耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}